{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vintage Pinball is a retro pinball game with soothing sounds and attractive graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and enjoy the ball movement and the sound of the ball bouncing off the pins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/1d8535106f89be3219748cecc223d961.poster.avif?t=1752763826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/1d8535106f89be3219748cecc223d961.webm?t=1752763826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/1d8535106f89be3219748cecc223d961.mp4?t=1752763826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Progress</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull the stick in front of you on the right to launch the ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the ball into the hole with the score written on it to earn a score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple stages to play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/043e2afbc8b5069c69bc109997cb2f5b.poster.avif?t=1752763826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/043e2afbc8b5069c69bc109997cb2f5b.webm?t=1752763826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/043e2afbc8b5069c69bc109997cb2f5b.mp4?t=1752763826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa